      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/74df32/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2019-07-17T17:56:35.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I love PbtA, but Masks hits a genere I&nbsp;have no personal interest in running, so I&nbsp;have only briefly looked through the book.</p>\n<p>I'd recommend going to rpg.net, where I know a lot of people have played it, and asking there.&nbsp; The community is super helpful.</p>",
