      "created_at": "2019-07-18T02:18:13.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>@Blackfang108 thanks, I’ll give that a try!</p>\n<p>@Ario yeah, the maturing of characters is a real difference even from other PbtA games I think. I’m planning to give a bit of a speech about how the characters’ sense of identity is going to shift from their initial concept, that adulthood is pretty much inevitable, etc. Hopefully that will set the right expectations!</p>",
