      "created_at": "2019-07-18T16:33:17.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yeah, I've attempted a few games of Masks and I met only marginal success with it. Granted, I'm also a very inexperienced GM. I like the idea of growing up as a hero but it's hard to set that expectation.</p>",
